    "wallet_action_resource_records_hint": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "سجل واحد لكل سطر، على سبيل المثال: \nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example. 192.0.2.1\nTXT \"مرحبًا\" \n\n المدعوم: NS، GLUE4، GLUE6، SYNTH4، SYNTH6، DS، TXT. اتركه فارغًا للمسح. متقدم: سداسي عشري:00..."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Datensatz pro Zeile, zum Beispiel:\nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example. 192.0.2.1\nTXT „Hallo“\n\nUnterstützt: NS, GLUE4, GLUE6, SYNTH4, SYNTH6, DS, TXT. Zum Löschen leer lassen. Erweitert: hex:00…"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One record per line, for example:\nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example. 192.0.2.1\nTXT \"hello\"\n\nSupported: NS, GLUE4, GLUE6, SYNTH4, SYNTH6, DS, TXT. Leave empty to clear. Advanced: hex:00…"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un registro por línea, por ejemplo: \nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example. 192.0.2.1\nTXT \"hola\"\n\nCompatible con: NS, GLUE4, GLUE6, SYNTH4, SYNTH6, DS, TXT. Dejar vacío para borrar. Avanzado: hexadecimal: 00…"
          }
        },
        "fa": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "یک رکورد در هر خط، برای مثال:\nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example. 192.0.2.1\nTXT \"سلام\"\n\n پشتیبانی شده: NS، GLUE4، GLUE6، SYNTH4، SYNTH6، DS، TXT. خالی بگذارید تا پاک شود. پیشرفته: hex:00…"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un enregistrement par ligne, par exemple :\nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example. 192.0.2.1\nTXT \"bonjour\"\n\nSupporté : NS, GLUE4, GLUE6, SYNTH4, SYNTH6, DS, TXT. Laissez vide pour effacer. Avancé : hexadécimal : 00 …"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "רשומה אחת בכל שורה, לדוגמה:\nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example. 192.0.2.1\nTXT \"שלום\"\n\n נתמך: NS, GLUE4, GLUE6, SYNTH4, SYNTH6, DS, TXT. השאר ריק כדי לפנות. מתקדם: hex:00…"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "प्रति पंक्ति एक रिकॉर्ड, उदाहरण के लिए:\nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example. 192.0.2.1\nTXT \"हैलो\" \n\nसमर्थित: NS, GLUE4, GLUE6, SYNTH4, SYNTH6, DS, TXT। साफ़ करने के लिए खाली छोड़ दें. उन्नत: हेक्स:00…"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Satu catatan per baris, misalnya:\nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example. 192.0.2.1\nTXT \"halo\"\n\nDidukung: NS, GLUE4, GLUE6, SYNTH4, SYNTH6, DS, TXT. Biarkan kosong untuk dibersihkan. Lanjutan: hex:00…"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un record per riga, ad esempio:\nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example. 192.0.2.1\nTXT \"ciao\"\n\nSupportato: NS, GLUE4, GLUE6, SYNTH4, SYNTH6, DS, TXT. Lascia vuoto per cancellare. Avanzato: esa:00…"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 行に 1 つのレコード。例:\nNS ns1.例。\nGLUE4 ns1.例。192.0.2.1\nTXT「こんにちは」\n\nサポートされている: NS、GLUE4、GLUE6、SYNTH4、SYNTH6、DS、TXT。クリアするには空のままにします。上級: 16 進数:00…"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "줄당 하나의 레코드입니다(예: \nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example). 192.0.2.1\nTXT \"안녕하세요\"\n\n지원: NS, GLUE4, GLUE6, SYNTH4, SYNTH6, DS, TXT. 지우려면 비워 두세요. 고급: 16진수:00…"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eén record per regel, bijvoorbeeld:\nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example. 192.0.2.1\nTXT \"hallo\"\n\nOndersteund: NS, GLUE4, GLUE6, SYNTH4, SYNTH6, DS, TXT. Laat leeg om te wissen. Geavanceerd: hex:00…"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeden rekord w wierszu, na przykład: \nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example. 192.0.2.1\nTXT \"cześć\"\n\nObsługiwane: NS, GLUE4, GLUE6, SYNTH4, SYNTH6, DS, TXT. Pozostaw puste, aby wyczyścić. Zaawansowane: hex:00…"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um registro por linha, por exemplo:\nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example. 192.0.2.1\nTXT \"olá\"\n\nSuportado: NS, GLUE4, GLUE6, SYNTH4, SYNTH6, DS, TXT. Deixe vazio para limpar. Avançado: hex:00…"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "По одной записи в строке, например: \nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example. 192.0.2.1\nTXT \"привет\" \n\nПоддерживается: NS, GLUE4, GLUE6, SYNTH4, SYNTH6, DS, TXT. Оставьте пустым, чтобы очистить. Расширенный: шестнадцатеричный:00…"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Satır başına bir kayıt, örneğin:\nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example. 192.0.2.1\nTXT \"merhaba\"\n\nDesteklenen: NS, GLUE4, GLUE6, SYNTH4, SYNTH6, DS, TXT. Temizlemek için boş bırakın. Gelişmiş: hex:00…"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Один запис на рядок, наприклад: \nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example. 192.0.2.1\nTXT \"привіт\"\n\nПідтримується: NS, GLUE4, GLUE6, SYNTH4, SYNTH6, DS, TXT. Залиште порожнім, щоб очистити. Додатково: hex:00…"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Một bản ghi trên mỗi dòng, ví dụ:\nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example. 192.0.2.1\nTXT \"xin chào\"\n\nHỗ trợ: NS, GLUE4, GLUE6, SYNTH4, SYNTH6, DS, TXT. Để trống để xóa. Nâng cao: hex: 00…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行一条记录，例如：\nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example。 192.0.2.1\nTXT“你好”\n\n支持：NS、GLUE4、GLUE6、SYNTH4、SYNTH6、DS、TXT。留空以清除。高级：十六进制：00…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行一筆記錄，例如：\nNS ns1.example.\nGLUE4 ns1.example。 192.0.2.1\nTXT「你好」\n\n支援：NS、GLUE4、GLUE6、SYNTH4、SYNTH6、DS、TXT。留空以清除。高級：十六進位：00…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
